### 1. Login (run once at the start)  先登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "charlie", "password": "password123"}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Watch the round  看现在是哪个阶段
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rounds/current

### 3. My balance  我的余额
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallet/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Place bet 100 (during BETTING)  下注
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 100, "requestId": "{{$uuid}}"}

> {%
    client.test("Bet placed", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Got " + response.status + " " + JSON.stringify(response.body));
    });
%}

### 5. Cash out (during RUNNING)  提现
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bets/cashout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.test("Cashed out", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Got " + response.status + " " + JSON.stringify(response.body));
    });
%}

### 6. My bet history  下注记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Double-click test: change the id each round (-1, -2, -3…)  连点测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 100, "requestId": "double-click-1"}